    {
      "type": "thinking",
      "thinking": "I need to plan out the full single-file app: people management with validation, expense entry with cent-precision splitting and remainder distribution in trip order, newest-first listing with delete, balance calculations with proper data attributes, a settle-up algorithm minimizing transfers, and CAD currency formatting with localStorage persistence.\n\nFor styling I'm leaning toward Fraunces for headings paired with Inter for body text, using tabular numbers for money, with a harbour navy and signal red-orange palette, plus empty states and responsive support down to 360px with accessibility in mind.\n\nFor amount input, I'll use a text field with decimal inputmode and regex validation requiring up to two decimal places, computing cents directly from the string split rather than floating-point math to avoid rounding errors, then handling balances as paid minus share in cents with a greedy settle-up algorithm sorting creditors and debtors.\n\nNo person deletion is needed, and balances should display for everyone including zero amounts. Form errors render as elements that only appear while active, payer selection persists across re-renders, and split checkboxes default to everyone checked, with new people added as checked while preserving existing selections -- resetting to all-checked after a successful expense submission.\n\nI'm keeping the expense form enabled even with no people present, showing a validation message on submit instead of disabling it. Now I'm planning the layout as a responsive grid with people/expense entry on one side and expenses/balances/settle-up on the other, picking out a color palette (harbour blue, signal orange-red, cream background) that meets contrast requirements, before moving into writing the actual JavaScript.\n\nWriting state model and logic...\n\n",
      "signature": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en-CA\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Even Keel — split trip costs fairly</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Add the people on your trip, log who paid for what, and see who owes whom so everyone ends up even.\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,500;9..144,600&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n  :root{\n    --harbour:#1F3A4D;\n    --harbour-deep:#15293A;\n    --harbour-tint:#E6EDF2;\n    --signal:#C2462B;\n    --signal-tint:#FBEAE5;\n    --sand:#F5F1EA;\n    --paper:#FFFFFF;\n    --ink:#1B2730;\n    --ink-soft:#4F5F6B;\n    --line:#D9D2C6;\n    --line-soft:#E9E3D9;\n    --radius:10px;\n    --font-head:\"Fraunces\", Georgia, serif;\n    --font-body:\"Inter\", system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  *,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html{-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}\n  body{\n    margin:0;\n    font-family:var(--font-body);\n    font-size:16px;\n    line-height:1.5;\n    color:var(--ink);\n    background:var(--sand);\n    min-width:320px;\n  }\n  h1,h2,h3{font-family:var(--font-head);font-weight:600;line-height:1.15;margin:0;color:var(--harbour)}\n  p{margin:0}\n  button,input,select{font:inherit;color:inherit}\n  :focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--signal);outline-offset:2px;border-radius:4px}\n  .visually-hidden{position:absolute!important;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0}\n\n  /* Header */\n  .masthead{\n    background:var(--harbour);\n    color:#fff;\n    padding:20px 16px 22px;\n    border-bottom:4px solid var(--signal);\n  }\n  .masthead .inner{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px 24px}\n  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\n  .brand h1{color:#fff;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-0.01em}\n  .brand .mark{width:34px;height:34px;flex:0 0 auto}\n  .masthead .tagline{color:#CFDAE2;font-size:15px}\n  .summary{display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:14px;color:#CFDAE2}\n  .summary strong{color:#fff;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n\n  /* Layout */\n  main{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px 16px 56px}\n  .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}\n  @media(min-width:860px){\n    .grid{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,5fr) minmax(0,7fr);gap:24px;align-items:start}\n    main{padding-top:28px}\n  }\n  .col{display:grid;gap:20px;min-width:0}\n\n  .card{\n    background:var(--paper);\n    border:1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius:var(--radius);\n    padding:20px;\n    min-width:0;\n  }\n  .card-head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-bottom:14px}\n  .card-head h2{font-size:22px}\n  .card-head .count{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n  .lede{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:14px;margin-bottom:14px}\n\n  /* Forms */\n  label{display:block;font-weight:500;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:6px;color:var(--ink)}\n  .hint{font-weight:400;color:var(--ink-soft)}\n  .field{margin-bottom:14px;min-width:0}\n  input[type=text],select{\n    width:100%;\n    padding:10px 12px;\n    border:1px solid #8E9AA3;\n    border-radius:8px;\n    background:#fff;\n    min-height:44px;\n  }\n  input[type=text]:focus-visible,select:focus-visible{border-color:var(--harbour);outline-offset:0}\n  .amount-wrap{position:relative}\n  .amount-wrap .cur{position:absolute;left:12px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);color:var(--ink-soft);pointer-events:none}\n  .amount-wrap input{padding-left:26px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n  .row{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-end;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .row .field{flex:1 1 200px;margin-bottom:0}\n  .two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px}\n  @media(min-width:480px){.two{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}\n\n  .btn{\n    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;\n    min-height:44px;padding:10px 18px;\n    border-radius:8px;border:1px solid transparent;\n    font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap;\n    transition:background .15s,color .15s;\n  }\n  .btn-primary{background:var(--harbour);color:#fff}\n  .btn-primary:hover{background:var(--harbour-deep)}\n  .btn-signal{background:var(--signal);color:#fff}\n  .btn-signal:hover{background:#A83A22}\n  .btn-ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--ink-soft);border-color:var(--line);min-height:36px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500}\n  .btn-ghost:hover{color:var(--signal);border-color:var(--signal);background:var(--signal-tint)}\n  .btn-block{width:100%}\n\n  .checks{\n    display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\n    padding:4px 0 0;border:0;margin:0;min-width:0;\n  }\n  .checks legend{padding:0;margin-bottom:6px;font-weight:500;font-size:14px}\n  .check{\n    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\n    padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;\n    background:var(--sand);cursor:pointer;font-size:14px;\n    max-width:100%;\n  }\n  .check:has(input:checked){background:var(--harbour-tint);border-color:var(--harbour);color:var(--harbour)}\n  .check:has(input:focus-visible){outline:3px solid var(--signal);outline-offset:2px}\n  .check input{width:18px;height:18px;margin:0;accent-color:var(--harbour);flex:0 0 auto}\n  .check input:focus-visible{outline:none}\n  .check span{overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}\n  .split-tools{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:8px}\n  .linkish{background:none;border:0;padding:4px 0;color:var(--harbour);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;cursor:pointer;font-size:14px}\n  .linkish:hover{color:var(--signal)}\n\n  .error{\n    margin-top:10px;\n    padding:10px 12px;\n    background:var(--signal-tint);\n    border-left:3px solid var(--signal);\n    border-radius:0 6px 6px 0;\n    color:#8F3019;\n    font-size:14px;\n  }\n\n  /* Lists */\n  ul.list{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\n  .empty{\n    padding:18px;border:1px dashed var(--line);border-radius:8px;\n    color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:14px;background:var(--sand);\n  }\n  .empty strong{color:var(--harbour);font-family:var(--font-head);font-weight:600;font-size:16px;display:block;margin-bottom:4px}\n\n  .people{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\n  .people li{\n    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\n    padding:6px 12px 6px 6px;border-radius:999px;\n    background:var(--harbour-tint);color:var(--harbour);font-weight:500;font-size:14px;\n    max-width:100%;\n  }\n  .avatar{\n    width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;flex:0 0 auto;\n    background:var(--harbour);color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;\n    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;letter-spacing:.02em;\n  }\n  .people li span.nm{overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}\n\n  .expense{\n    display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:4px 14px;\n    padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line-soft);\n  }\n  .expense:first-child{border-top:0;padding-top:0}\n  .expense .desc{font-weight:600;overflow-wrap:anywhere}\n  .expense .amt{font-family:var(--font-head);font-size:20px;color:var(--harbour);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap}\n  .expense .meta{grid-column:1/-1;font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-soft);overflow-wrap:anywhere}\n  .expense .meta b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:500}\n  .expense .actions{grid-column:1/-1;margin-top:6px}\n\n  .balance{\n    display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr) auto;align-items:center;gap:12px;\n    padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line-soft);\n  }\n  .balance:first-child{border-top:0;padding-top:0}\n  .balance .nm{font-weight:500;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}\n  .balance .state{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft)}\n  .balance .amt{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;text-align:right}\n  .balance.owed .amt{color:var(--harbour)}\n  .balance.owes .amt{color:var(--signal)}\n  .balance.even .amt{color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:500}\n\n  .transfer{\n    display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:4px 12px;align-items:center;\n    padding:12px 14px;margin-top:8px;\n    background:var(--sand);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;\n  }\n  .transfer:first-child{margin-top:0}\n  .transfer .who{overflow-wrap:anywhere}\n  .transfer .who b{font-weight:600;color:var(--harbour)}\n  .transfer .arrow{color:var(--signal);margin:0 6px}\n  .transfer .amt{font-family:var(--font-head);font-size:20px;color:var(--harbour);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}\n  .settled{\n    display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;\n    padding:14px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--harbour-tint);color:var(--harbour);font-size:14px;\n  }\n  .settled svg{flex:0 0 auto;margin-top:2px}\n\n  footer{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 32px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:13px}\n  footer button{margin-left:6px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header class=\"masthead\">\n  <div class=\"inner\">\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"brand\">\n        <svg class=\"mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 34 34\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\">\n          <circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#fff\" opacity=\".12\"/>\n          <path d=\"M5 20c4-3 8 3 12 0s8 3 12 0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <path d=\"M17 6v10\" stroke=\"#C2462B\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <path d=\"M11 11h12\" stroke=\"#C2462B\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <h1>Even Keel</h1>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"tagline\">Log what each of you paid. See who owes whom. End the trip even.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"summary\" id=\"summary\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main data-testid=\"app\">\n  <div class=\"grid\">\n    <div class=\"col\">\n      <!-- People -->\n      <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"people-h\">\n        <div class=\"card-head\">\n          <h2 id=\"people-h\">People</h2>\n          <span class=\"count\" id=\"people-count\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"lede\">Start with everyone who is sharing costs on this trip.</p>\n        <form id=\"person-form\" novalidate>\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"field\">\n              <label for=\"person-name\">Name</label>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"person-name\" data-testid=\"person-name\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"e.g. Ana\" maxlength=\"40\">\n            </div>\n            <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-testid=\"add-person\">Add person</button>\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"person-error\"></div>\n        </form>\n        <div id=\"people-list\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"></div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Add expense -->\n      <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"add-expense-h\">\n        <div class=\"card-head\">\n          <h2 id=\"add-expense-h\">Add an expense</h2>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"lede\">One person paid; the cost is split equally between whoever you tick.</p>\n        <form id=\"expense-form\" novalidate>\n          <div class=\"field\">\n            <label for=\"expense-desc\">What was it for?</label>\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"expense-desc\" data-testid=\"expense-desc\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"e.g. Groceries, ferry tickets\" maxlength=\"80\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"two\">\n            <div class=\"field\">\n              <label for=\"expense-amount\">Amount <span class=\"hint\">(CAD)</span></label>\n              <div class=\"amount-wrap\">\n                <span class=\"cur\" aria-hidden=\"true\">$</span>\n                <input type=\"text\" id=\"expense-amount\" data-testid=\"expense-amount\" inputmode=\"decimal\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"0.00\">\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"field\">\n              <label for=\"expense-payer\">Who paid?</label>\n              <select id=\"expense-payer\" data-testid=\"expense-payer\"></select>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <fieldset class=\"checks\" id=\"expense-split\" data-testid=\"expense-split\">\n            <legend>Split between</legend>\n          </fieldset>\n          <div class=\"split-tools\" id=\"split-tools\">\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"linkish\" id=\"split-all\">Select everyone</button>\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"linkish\" id=\"split-none\">Clear</button>\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"expense-error\"></div>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n            <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-signal btn-block\" data-testid=\"add-expense\">Add expense</button>\n          </div>\n        </form>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"col\">\n      <!-- Balances -->\n      <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"balances-h\">\n        <div class=\"card-head\">\n          <h2 id=\"balances-h\">Where everyone stands</h2>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"lede\">What each of you paid, minus your share of everything. Owing a friend is normal — this just keeps it clear.</p>\n        <div id=\"balances\"></div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Settle up -->\n      <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"settle-h\">\n        <div class=\"card-head\">\n          <h2 id=\"settle-h\">Settle up</h2>\n          <span class=\"count\" id=\"settle-count\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"lede\">The fewest transfers that bring everyone back to zero.</p>\n        <div id=\"settle\"></div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Expenses -->\n      <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"expenses-h\">\n        <div class=\"card-head\">\n          <h2 id=\"expenses-h\">Expenses</h2>\n          <span class=\"count\" id=\"expenses-count\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"expenses\"></div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</main>\n<footer>\n  Saved on this device. <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\" id=\"reset\">Start a new trip</button>\n</footer>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  'use strict';\n  const STORAGE_KEY = 'even-keel-v1';\n  const fmt = new Intl.NumberFormat('en-CA', { style: 'currency', currency: 'CAD' });\n  const money = c => fmt.format(c / 100);\n\n  // ---------- State ----------\n  let state = load();\n  function load(){\n    try {\n      const raw = localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY);\n      if (raw) {\n        const s = JSON.parse(raw);\n        if (s && Array.isArray(s.people) && Array.isArray(s.expenses)) return s;\n      }\n    } catch(e){}\n    return { people: [], expenses: [] };\n  }\n  function save(){\n    try { localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY, JSON.stringify(state)); } catch(e){}\n  }\n\n  // ---------- DOM ----------\n  const $ = id => document.getElementById(id);\n  const personForm = $('person-form'), personName = $('person-name'), personError = $('person-error');\n  const expenseForm = $('expense-form'), descEl = $('expense-desc'), amountEl = $('expense-amount'),\n        payerEl = $('expense-payer'), splitEl = $('expense-split'), expenseError = $('expense-error');\n\n  // ---------- Helpers ----------\n  function el(tag, attrs, children){\n    const n = document.createElement(tag);\n    if (attrs) for (const k in attrs) {\n      if (k === 'class') n.className = attrs[k];\n      else if (k === 'text') n.textContent = attrs[k];\n      else n.setAttribute(k, attrs[k]);\n    }\n    if (children) children.forEach(c => { if (c != null) n.appendChild(typeof c === 'string' ? document.createTextNode(c) : c); });\n    return n;\n  }\n  function initials(name){\n    const parts = name.split(/\\s+/).filter(Boolean);\n    return (parts[0][0] + (parts[1] ? parts[1][0] : '')).toUpperCase();\n  }\n  function showError(container, msg){\n    container.innerHTML = '';\n    container.appendChild(el('div', { class: 'error', role: 'alert', 'data-testid': 'form-error', text: msg }));\n  }\n  function clearError(container){ container.innerHTML = ''; }\n  function listNames(names){\n    if (names.length === 1) return names[0];\n    if (names.length === 2) return names[0] + ' and ' + names[1];\n    return names.slice(0, -1).join(', ') + ' and ' + names[names.length - 1];\n  }\n\n  // Shares in integer cents; leftover cents go one each to the split people in trip order.\n  function shares(exp){\n    const order = state.people.filter(p => exp.split.includes(p));\n    const n = order.length, base = Math.floor(exp.cents / n), rem = exp.cents % n;\n    const out = {};\n    order.forEach((p, i) => { out[p] = base + (i < rem ? 1 : 0); });\n    return out;\n  }\n  function balances(){\n    const b = {};\n    state.people.forEach(p => b[p] = 0);\n    state.expenses.forEach(e => {\n      if (b[e.payer] !== undefined) b[e.payer] += e.cents;\n      const s = shares(e);\n      for (const p in s) if (b[p] !== undefined) b[p] -= s[p];\n    });\n    return b;\n  }\n  function settle(b){\n    const debtors = [], creditors = [];\n    state.people.forEach(p => {\n      if (b[p] < 0) debtors.push({ name: p, amt: -b[p] });\n      else if (b[p] > 0) creditors.push({ name: p, amt: b[p] });\n    });\n    debtors.sort((a, c) => c.amt - a.amt);\n    creditors.sort((a, c) => c.amt - a.amt);\n    const out = [];\n    let i = 0, j = 0;\n    while (i < debtors.length && j < creditors.length) {\n      const pay = Math.min(debtors[i].amt, creditors[j].amt);\n      out.push({ from: debtors[i].name, to: creditors[j].name, cents: pay });\n      debtors[i].amt -= pay; creditors[j].amt -= pay;\n      if (debtors[i].amt === 0) i++;\n      if (creditors[j].amt === 0) j++;\n    }\n    return out;\n  }\n  function parseCents(str){\n    const s = str.trim().replace(/^\\$/, '').replace(/,/g, '');\n    if (!/^\\d+(\\.\\d{1,2})?$/.test(s)) return null;\n    const [whole, frac = ''] = s.split('.');\n    return parseInt(whole, 10) * 100 + parseInt((frac + '00').slice(0, 2), 10);\n  }\n\n  // ---------- Render ----------\n  function render(){\n    renderSummary();\n    renderPeople();\n    renderExpenseForm();\n    renderExpenses();\n    renderBalances();\n  }\n\n  function renderSummary(){\n    const total = state.expenses.reduce((a, e) => a + e.cents, 0);\n    const s = $('summary');\n    s.innerHTML = '';\n    s.appendChild(el('span', {}, [el('strong', { text: String(state.people.length) }), ' ' + (state.people.length === 1 ? 'person' : 'people')]));\n    s.appendChild(el('span', {}, [el('strong', { text: String(state.expenses.length) }), ' ' + (state.expenses.length === 1 ? 'expense' : 'expenses')]));\n    s.appendChild(el('span', {}, [el('strong', { text: money(total) }), ' total']));\n  }\n\n  function renderPeople(){\n    const wrap = $('people-list');\n    wrap.innerHTML = '';\n    $('people-count').textContent = state.people.length ? state.people.length + ' on the trip' : '';\n    if (!state.people.length) {\n      wrap.appendChild(el('div', { class: 'empty' }, [\n        el('strong', { text: 'No one here yet' }),\n        'Add each person on the trip, including yourself. You can add expenses once there is at least one name.'\n      ]));\n      return;\n    }\n    const ul = el('ul', { class: 'list people', 'aria-label': 'People on the trip' });\n    state.people.forEach(p => {\n      ul.appendChild(el('li', { 'data-testid': 'person' }, [\n        el('span', { class: 'avatar', 'aria-hidden': 'true', text: initials(p) }),\n        el('span', { class: 'nm', text: p })\n      ]));\n    });\n    wrap.appendChild(ul);\n  }\n\n  function renderExpenseForm(){\n    // Payer select: keep current selection where possible\n    const prevPayer = payerEl.value;\n    payerEl.innerHTML = '';\n    if (!state.people.length) {\n      payerEl.appendChild(el('option', { value: '', text: 'Add people first' }));\n      payerEl.disabled = true;\n    } else {\n      payerEl.disabled = false;\n      state.people.forEach(p => payerEl.appendChild(el('option', { value: p, text: p })));\n      if (state.people.includes(prevPayer)) payerEl.value = prevPayer;\n    }\n    // Split checkboxes: keep existing choices, new people checked by default\n    const prevChecks = {};\n    splitEl.querySelectorAll('input[type=checkbox]').forEach(c => prevChecks[c.value] = c.checked);\n    splitEl.querySelectorAll('label').forEach(l => l.remove());\n    const emptyNote = splitEl.querySelector('.hint-empty');\n    if (emptyNote) emptyNote.remove();\n    if (!state.people.length) {\n      splitEl.appendChild(el('span', { class: 'hint hint-empty', style: 'font-size:14px', text: 'Everyone you add will appear here.' }));\n    }\n    state.people.forEach((p, i) => {\n      const id = 'split-' + i;\n      const input = el('input', { type: 'checkbox', id, value: p, name: 'split' });\n      input.checked = (p in prevChecks) ? prevChecks[p] : true;\n      splitEl.appendChild(el('label', { class: 'check', for: id }, [input, el('span', { text: p })]));\n    });\n    $('split-tools').style.display = state.people.length ? '' : 'none';\n  }\n\n  function renderExpenses(){\n    const wrap = $('expenses');\n    wrap.innerHTML = '';\n    $('expenses-count').textContent = state.expenses.length ? 'newest first' : '';\n    if (!state.expenses.length) {\n      wrap.appendChild(el('div', { class: 'empty' }, [\n        el('strong', { text: 'Nothing logged yet' }),\n        state.people.length\n          ? 'Add the first thing someone paid for — dinner, fuel, the place you stayed. Every expense shows up here with who it was split between.'\n          : 'Once you have added people, log what each of them paid for and it will show up here.'\n      ]));\n      return;\n    }\n    const ul = el('ul', { class: 'list', 'aria-label': 'Expenses' });\n    [...state.expenses].reverse().forEach(e => {\n      const n = e.split.length;\n      const li = el('li', { class: 'expense', 'data-testid': 'expense' }, [\n        el('div', { class: 'desc', text: e.desc }),\n        el('div', { class: 'amt', text: money(e.cents) }),\n        el('div', { class: 'meta' }, [\n          'Paid by ', el('b', { text: e.payer }),\n          ' · split ' + (n === 1 ? 'with ' : n + ' ways between '),\n          el('b', { text: listNames(e.split) })\n        ])\n      ]);\n      const del = el('button', { type: 'button', class: 'btn btn-ghost', 'data-testid': 'delete-expense', 'aria-label': 'Remove ' + e.desc, text: 'Remove' });\n      del.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        state.expenses = state.expenses.filter(x => x.id !== e.id);\n        save(); render();\n      });\n      li.appendChild(el('div', { class: 'actions' }, [del]));\n      ul.appendChild(li);\n    });\n    wrap.appendChild(ul);\n  }\n\n  function renderBalances(){\n    const bWrap = $('balances'), sWrap = $('settle');\n    bWrap.innerHTML = ''; sWrap.innerHTML = ''; $('settle-count').textContent = '';\n    if (!state.people.length) {\n      bWrap.appendChild(el('div', { class: 'empty' }, [el('strong', { text: 'Balances appear here' }), 'Add people and a few expenses and you will see who is ahead and who is behind.']));\n      sWrap.appendChild(el('div', { class: 'empty' }, [el('strong', { text: 'Nothing to settle' }), 'When balances are uneven, the transfers that fix it will be listed here.']));\n      return;\n    }\n    const b = balances();\n    const ul = el('ul', { class: 'list', 'aria-label': 'Balances' });\n    state.people.forEach(p => {\n      const c = b[p];\n      const cls = c > 0 ? 'owed' : c < 0 ? 'owes' : 'even';\n      const stateText = c > 0 ? 'is owed' : c < 0 ? 'owes' : 'even';\n      ul.appendChild(el('li', { class: 'balance ' + cls, 'data-testid': 'balance', 'data-person': p, 'data-cents': String(c) }, [\n        el('span', { class: 'avatar', 'aria-hidden': 'true', text: initials(p) }),\n        el('span', {}, [el('div', { class: 'nm', text: p }), el('div', { class: 'state', text: stateText })]),\n        el('span', { class: 'amt', text: (c < 0 ? '−' : '') + money(Math.abs(c)) })\n      ]));\n    });\n    bWrap.appendChild(ul);\n\n    if (!state.expenses.length) {\n      sWrap.appendChild(el('div', { class: 'empty' }, [el('strong', { text: 'Nothing to settle yet' }), 'Log some expenses and the transfers that even things out will appear here.']));\n      return;\n    }\n    const transfers = settle(b);\n    if (!transfers.length) {\n      sWrap.appendChild(el('div', { class: 'settled' }, [\n        el('span', { 'aria-hidden': 'true' }, [svgCheck()]),\n        el('span', {}, [el('b', { text: 'You are all even. ' }), 'Nobody owes anyone anything.'])\n      ]));\n      return;\n    }\n    $('settle-count').textContent = transfers.length + (transfers.length === 1 ? ' transfer' : ' transfers');\n    const tl = el('ul', { class: 'list', 'aria-label': 'Transfers to settle up' });\n    transfers.forEach(t => {\n      tl.appendChild(el('li', { class: 'transfer', 'data-testid': 'transfer', 'data-from': t.from, 'data-to': t.to, 'data-cents': String(t.cents) }, [\n        el('span', { class: 'who' }, [el('b', { text: t.from }), ' pays', el('span', { class: 'arrow', 'aria-hidden': 'true', text: '→' }), el('b', { text: t.to })]),\n        el('span', { class: 'amt', text: money(t.cents) })\n      ]));\n    });\n    sWrap.appendChild(tl);\n  }\n  function svgCheck(){\n    const s = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'svg');\n    s.setAttribute('width', '18'); s.setAttribute('height', '18'); s.setAttribute('viewBox', '0 0 18 18');\n    s.innerHTML = '<circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"9\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#1F3A4D\"/><path d=\"M5 9.5l2.5 2.5L13 6.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>';\n    return s;\n  }\n\n  // ---------- Events ----------\n  personForm.addEventListener('submit', ev => {\n    ev.preventDefault();\n    const name = personName.value.trim();\n    if (!name) { showError(personError, 'Enter a name before adding someone.'); personName.focus(); return; }\n    if (state.people.some(p => p.toLowerCase() === name.toLowerCase())) {\n      showError(personError, '“' + name + '” is already on the trip. Names need to be different, even ignoring capitals.');\n      personName.focus(); personName.select(); return;\n    }\n    clearError(personError);\n    state.people.push(name);\n    save(); render();\n    personName.value = '';\n    personName.focus();\n  });\n  personName.addEventListener('input', () => clearError(personError));\n\n  expenseForm.addEventListener('submit', ev => {\n    ev.preventDefault();\n    const desc = descEl.value.trim();\n    const cents = parseCents(amountEl.value);\n    const payer = payerEl.value;\n    const split = [...splitEl.querySelectorAll('input[type=checkbox]:checked')].map(c => c.value);\n\n    if (!state.people.length) { showError(expenseError, 'Add at least one person before logging an expense.'); personName.focus(); return; }\n    if (!desc) { showError(expenseError, 'Say what the expense was for.'); descEl.focus(); return; }\n    if (!amountEl.value.trim()) { showError(expenseError, 'Enter the amount paid.'); amountEl.focus(); return; }\n    if (cents === null) { showError(expenseError, 'Enter the amount as dollars and cents, like 42 or 42.50, with at most two decimals.'); amountEl.focus(); return; }\n    if (cents <= 0) { showError(expenseError, 'The amount needs to be more than $0.00.'); amountEl.focus(); return; }\n    if (!payer || !state.people.includes(payer)) { showError(expenseError, 'Choose who paid.'); payerEl.focus(); return; }\n    if (!split.length) { showError(expenseError, 'Tick at least one person to split this between.'); const first = splitEl.querySelector('input'); if (first) first.focus(); return; }\n\n    clearError(expenseError);\n    state.expenses.push({ id: Date.now().toString(36) + Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 7), desc, cents, payer, split: state.people.filter(p => split.includes(p)) });\n    save();\n    descEl.value = ''; amountEl.value = '';\n    splitEl.querySelectorAll('input[type=checkbox]').forEach(c => c.checked = true);\n    render();\n    descEl.focus();\n  });\n  [descEl, amountEl, payerEl, splitEl].forEach(n => n.addEventListener('input', () => clearError(expenseError)));\n\n  $('split-all').addEventListener('click', () => { splitEl.querySelectorAll('input').forEach(c => c.checked = true); clearError(expenseError); });\n  $('split-none').addEventListener('click', () => { splitEl.querySelectorAll('input').forEach(c => c.checked = false); });\n\n  $('reset').addEventListener('click', () => {\n    if (!state.people.length && !state.expenses.length) return;\n    if (confirm('Start a new trip? This removes everyone and every expense saved on this device.')) {\n      state = { people: [], expenses: [] };\n      save(); render(); personName.focus();\n    }\n  });\n\n  render();\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>"
